=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=874bb1567553c9470cc6d3482960b432 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "すずよるっ子みんなの集合絵絵が見たいです…！が、人数の関係でめっちゃ描くことになるので春夏冬ベルがみんなのぬいぐるみみたいなのを抱きしめてる絵とかでも大丈夫です！全員等身大でもいいですが…そこは本人の判断に任せます…！\n絵柄指定は無し　一番描きやすい描き方で描いてもらって大丈夫です！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Biss00000/works/1", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/0ca503bf/uploads/origins/604692f9-7bb1-49b0-bbaf-b4b72605e1c3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c67478dfa3aa7a3829af8f35c4045a93", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/0ca503bf/uploads/origins/604692f9-7bb1-49b0-bbaf-b4b72605e1c3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c67478dfa3aa7a3829af8f35c4045a93, https://si.imgix.net/0ca503bf/uploads/origins/604692f9-7bb1-49b0-bbaf-b4b72605e1c3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e6137c09e71ba0b536aad354f4a53d93 2x, https://si.imgix.net/0ca503bf/uploads/origins/604692f9-7bb1-49b0-bbaf-b4b72605e1c3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=16c18648a38287853e05962ac6cdde2f 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "I would like a picture of Sora and Shiho smiling! I don't have any wishes for composition, etc., but if possible, please use a horizontal screen~!\nSorry for the last minute request... Anytime is fine.\nI always love you!", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}]}